# Default owners for everything in the repository.
#
# These are the two accounts with admin access to kaltdev/kaltcode, verified
# from the repository collaborator list and the kaltdev org membership. Keep
# this list in sync with actual maintainers — a CODEOWNERS entry that names a
# non-maintainer silently routes review requests to the wrong place.
* @radityama @pratamarap

# Workflow and repository-governance changes gate the whole project's CI and
# release paths, so they stay explicitly with maintainers.
/.github/ @radityama @pratamarap

# Release automation and packaging are security-sensitive (npm publishing runs
# with an OIDC token from the `release` environment).
/release-please-config.json @radityama @pratamarap
/.release-please-manifest.json @radityama @pratamarap
/package.json @radityama @pratamarap
